# generated artifacts: outputs, not sources.  Every pattern below has a
# producer recorded in DATA_CATALOG.md §5-7 — regenerate, do not commit.
# Scripts in figures/ and benchmarks/ stay tracked, as does docs/fig_8.png
# (a paper input).  The .json findings under results/ stay tracked too.
figures/*.png
benchmarks/*.csv
results/*.csv
results/*.log
results/digitized/

